     "text": "Eternal buffs are ongoing self-enchantments that stack upward without a limit. Only one eternal buff can be active at a time — activating a new one removes the previous. Each use increases the buff's power and also increases the cost of the next enhancement: they consume increasing amounts of aim or mana with each stack. There is no cap on how high they can go, but the escalating cost creates a practical limit within a wave."
