    "mechanic": {
     "name": "Crescendo",
     "tag": null,
     "text": "The Minstrel tracks the number of buff-type ability actions used by any unit between his turns. Each unique buff action adds one stack of Crescendo, with a maximum cap defined per Crescendo ability. Crescendo resets when a Crescendo ability is used. Because buffs tend to be move and minor actions, building a high Crescendo count means investing smaller actions — creating a genuine trade-off between conventional buffing and setting up a powerful Crescendo payoff."
    },
