    "baseClass": "Binder",
    "worldNotes": "Every other Binder tradition involves some degree of asymmetry — the practitioner reaching toward something more powerful and managing that imbalance through skill, safeguards, or faith. The Pact Master has closed that gap. Through decades of accumulated power and understanding, the Pact Master negotiates with summoned entities as a genuine equal, offering terms rather than issuing commands or making supplications. Sandra Martin, who passed through the space between Heaven and Hell without training and survived, understands something about what lies beyond the veil that most Pact Masters spend lifetimes approaching. She arrived at that knowledge in an afternoon. It was not a pleasant afternoon.",
